Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:13:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] UniversalK: cite the published first-halt, visited-set
 monotonicity and halted-space lemmas; status text, and universalK's
 Implementation paragraph

Three inline arguments re-proved published lemmas: MultiTapeTM.exists_first_halt,
MultiTapeTM.visitedByTapeHead_mono and FinTM.ComputesInTime.spaceUsed_le_of_halt; they now cite
them. UniversalK's header and main results, SelfUniversal's status and the TuringMachine facade
state the contracts as proved, and universalK's docstring gains an Implementation paragraph.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
